      ],
      "source": "https://www.okhistory.org/publications/enc/entry?entry=VA003"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Dierks Forests, Inc. began its timber harvesting operations near Valliant in 1903 and eventually became one of the largest family-owned landholders in the country.",
